# Only pipeline/, api/, and requirements.txt are ever COPYed into the API
# image (see api/Dockerfile) — everything else here just bloats and slows
# down the build-context transfer, and .env/data/ must never reach a build.
.git/
.github/
dashboard/
docs/
tests/
data/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
.env
.env.example
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
README.md
SECURITY.md
DEPLOY.md
LICENSE
